{"path":"chrono/weekday_last/weekday_last","title":"std::chrono::weekday_last::weekday_last","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::weekday_last::</span>weekday_last","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/weekday_last/weekday_last","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs a weekday_last object storing the weekday wd.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> weekday_last<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/weekday\"><span class=\"kw2576\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">weekday</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> wd <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a <code>weekday_last</code> object storing the <span class=\"t-lc\">weekday</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">wd</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>A more convenient way to construct a <code>weekday_last</code> is with <code>weekday</code>'s <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span></span></code>, i.e., <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">wd<span class=\"br0\">[</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/last_spec\"><span class=\"kw2561\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">last</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">]</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> year_month_day ymd<span class=\"br0\">{</span>floor<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>days<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>system_clock<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">now</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> weekday_last wdl<span class=\"br0\">{</span>Sunday<span class=\"br0\">[</span>last<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// A last Sunday of a month</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> year_month_day last_sun<span class=\"br0\">{</span>ymd.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> ymd.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> wdl<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The last Sunday of current month falls on \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>last_sun.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'/'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>last_sun.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'/'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>last_sun.<span class=\"me1\">day</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The last Sunday of current month falls on 2021/9/26</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/weekday_last","title":"std::chrono::weekday_last"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::weekday_last::weekday_last","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Constructs a weekday_last object storing the weekday wd."},{"label":"Notes","note":"A more convenient way to construct a weekday_last is with weekday's operator[], i.e., wd[std::chrono::last]."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":99,"codeBlockCount":2}
